[{"id":"waterfall","title":"瀑布","author":"JiGuro","date":"2019-10-23","path":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/JiGuroLGC/JiGuroLGC.github.io@1.0.7/poetry/waterfall.md","preview":"还没看见瀑布，<br>先听见瀑布的声音。<br>哗啦哗啦哗啦，"},{"id":"childhood","title":"童年","author":"JiGuro","date":"2019-11-19","path":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/JiGuroLGC/JiGuroLGC.github.io@1.0.7/poetry/childhood.md","preview":"童年，<br>是以前的回忆。。<br>是田边的花，"},{"id":"live_earth","title":"好好活在人间","author":"JiGuro","date":"2019-12-02","path":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/JiGuroLGC/JiGuroLGC.github.io@1.0.7/poetry/live_earth.md","preview":"天上是神仙的世界，<br>地下是鬼魂的领土。<br>我需要的，"},{"id":"dream","title":"梦想","author":"JiGuro","date":"2019-12-04","path":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/JiGuroLGC/JiGuroLGC.github.io@1.0.7/poetry/dream.md","preview":"我的梦想，<br>像漫山遍野的花，<br>又像田边嫩绿的草。"},{"id":"heaven","title":"天堂","author":"JiGuro","date":"2020-01-04","path":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/JiGuroLGC/JiGuroLGC.github.io@1.0.7/poetry/heaven.md","preview":"我和你说，<br>满天白云的鲜红。<br>我和你讲，"},{"id":"lay_spring","title":"卧春","author":"JiGuro","date":"2020-02-11","path":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/JiGuroLGC/JiGuroLGC.github.io@1.0.7/poetry/lay_spring.md","preview":"仰卧在春天里，<br>用心倾听春天的声音，<br>尽情享受春日的阳光。"},{"id":"through_arbor","title":"走过绿意","author":"JiGuro","date":"2020-03-31","path":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/JiGuroLGC/JiGuroLGC.github.io@1.0.7/poetry/through_arbor.md","preview":"走过绿意，<br>看见一片绿荫。<br>葱葱郁郁，"},{"id":"snow_plum","title":"映雪梅·冬·孤","author":"JiGuro","date":"2020-05-02","path":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/JiGuroLGC/JiGuroLGC.github.io@1.0.7/poetry/snow_plum.md","preview":"墙角的梅花影子，<br>轻轻地摆动，<br>在暮色的映照下，"},{"id":"future_technology","title":"未来与科技","author":"JiGuro","date":"2021-07-29","path":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/JiGuroLGC/JiGuroLGC.github.io@1.0.7/poetry/future_technology.md","preview":"科技在进步，<br>人类同时也在进步。<br>我们不可能还在茅房破屋，"},{"id":"china_love","title":"中国，我爱你","author":"JiGuro","date":"2021-10-01","path":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/JiGuroLGC/JiGuroLGC.github.io@1.0.7/poetry/china_love.md","preview":"中国，我爱你。<br>你那历史悠久的文化，<br>你那百年沧桑的传统，"},{"id":"starry_sky","title":"浪漫星天","author":"JiGuro","date":"2021-12-07","path":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/JiGuroLGC/JiGuroLGC.github.io@1.0.7/poetry/starry_sky.md","preview":"星星点点，<br>月亮姐姐笑容满面。<br>星星点点，"},{"id":"chang_ge","title":"伪长歌行","author":"JiGuro","date":"2021-12-29","path":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/JiGuroLGC/JiGuroLGC.github.io@1.0.7/poetry/chang_ge.md","preview":"青青园中草，<br>夜雨洒绿地。<br>日烯耀绿意，"},{"id":"si_xiang","title":"伪醉花阴·思乡","author":"JiGuro","date":"2022-01-04","path":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/JiGuroLGC/JiGuroLGC.github.io@1.0.7/poetry/si_xiang.md","preview":"身处楼台中，<br>烟雨绕我身。<br>离家已日久，"},{"id":"sunlight","title":"阳光","author":"JiGuro","date":"2022-01-27","path":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/JiGuroLGC/JiGuroLGC.github.io@1.0.7/poetry/sunlight.md","preview":"他在一间房子里，<br>四面封死，<br>无人在旁。"},{"id":"spring_song","title":"春歌","author":"JiGuro","date":"2022-02-01","path":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/JiGuroLGC/JiGuroLGC.github.io@1.0.7/poetry/spring_song.md","preview":"画个桃符，<br>怡然自得贴门前。<br>拎把扫帚，"},{"id":"overlooking_hometown","title":"如梦令·隔海望故园","author":"JiGuro","date":"2022-04-20","path":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/JiGuroLGC/JiGuroLGC.github.io@1.0.7/poetry/overlooking_hometown.md","preview":"月照归人锄罢，<br>我卧秋汀望夜。<br>泪珠忽如雨，"},{"id":"praise_autumnwind","title":"咏秋风","author":"JiGuro","date":"2023-02-14","path":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/JiGuroLGC/JiGuroLGC.github.io@1.0.7/poetry/praise_autumnwind.md","preview":"人道秋风多悲凉，<br>我言此风入心房。<br>清风漾酒仰天笑，"},{"id":"idle","title":"十六字令·闲","author":"JiGuro","date":"2024-06-08","path":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/JiGuroLGC/JiGuroLGC.github.io@1.0.7/poetry/idle.md","preview":"闲，<br>倦倦风拂秀发洁。<br>微闭眼，"},{"id":"autumn_feelings","title":"水调歌头·秋日感怀","author":"JiGuro","date":"2024-07-26","path":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/JiGuroLGC/JiGuroLGC.github.io@1.0.7/poetry/autumn_feelings.md","preview":"紧闭朱门锁，<br>叶落更情伤。<br>千里心潮万浪，"},{"id":"childhood2","title":"童年 （二）","author":"JiGuro","date":"2025-03-04","path":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/JiGuroLGC/JiGuroLGC.github.io@1.0.7/poetry/childhood2.md","preview":"当斜阳倦倦唤起月亮，<br>水面仍漾着圈圈金光。<br>当野鸭衔着食物归巢，"},{"id":"myself","title":"自己","author":"JiGuro","date":"2025-09-15","path":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/JiGuroLGC/JiGuroLGC.github.io@1.0.7/poetry/myself.md","preview":"白的灯，<br>疲倦地笼在头顶。<br>转的扇，"},{"id":"if_I_die","title":"倘若我死了","author":"JiGuro","date":"2025-12-30","path":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/JiGuroLGC/JiGuroLGC.github.io@1.0.7/poetry/if_I_die.md","preview":"一阵阵哭声在耳边响起，<br>硝烟裹挟着爆竹屑炸得心惊。<br>棺木排着长龙来回穿行，"},{"id":"linchuan","title":"忆秦娥·临川","author":"JiGuro","date":"2026-04-24","path":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/JiGuroLGC/JiGuroLGC.github.io@1.0.7/poetry/linchuan.md","preview":"春水涨，<br>莺声软语江南巷。<br>江南巷，"},{"id":"songbie","title":"送别","author":"JiGuro","date":"2026-06-27","path":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/JiGuroLGC/JiGuroLGC.github.io@1.0.7/poetry/songbie.md","preview":"春归夏至祝挚友，<br>杨柳折枝送故人。<br>熊心壮志夺硕果，"}]